      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "specification skill or machine sidecar is required. An unresolved product decision"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "## Required Inputs"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "eaede2aac28e47b305b66776e3f61ef77990549464ec6a04e38312aec489fc76",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "- Keep missing sources, decisions and permissions visible; do not invent an accepted specification or a new tracking system."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c4e4e1bf9162c88b0b53066aaf4127766e14bacd71df9b9b44cb18adde506e7b",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "drafting useful independent scope. Do not require another approval turn when"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "cbc64546375076a815787b307645b7c53539e7587984d37531511bc81f60f1b9",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "tests and documentation to the outcome they enable. Isolate a prerequisite only"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e499a294c6c78be7656769e6e65b9d9c59203d83efec4f5432d96b3197e879a1",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "if its own observable contract can be reviewed independently. Do not size tasks"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "17681574ba881244558097a0ad833cfb90d8665f7038bd6b447f0f1ee7ffee88",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "tests. Do not impose blanket TDD, all-suite runs or commit-per-step rituals."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "620a808801761cf56a3dd4907e970a21a30803b18c3acfdea9e07abf25ea27bf",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "add or revise only authorized scope. Preserve completion claims only with their"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "049a2277a7480304e7a11adf0ef9a043800ecc637c3cc1ffa4319be926985d64",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "Do not create issues, send messages or change external tracker state unless"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "787b7c3efd2935e8cb65b8d657c269fb8d85ce98167c8f87ef0e3beb2485b57f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "chat when only planning is authorized."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d4a5d90fccd17968a3341f81b2d4864f60de61b71a198933dca475ecd4d9554d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "- Preserve requirement and task identity. Never recycle IDs, erase unchecked work,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a4c443398cb6c8eb7903b419d32afd18fc66ce461e6aa36b75945739698dd68d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "- `allowed_writes` narrows the task, never grants permission. `authority_ref` points"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "aa922503d2847d2ff9fd237441c6b04bb5000abfb28aa6b2fca7e003cd7f8a1e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "- Digest only inspected bytes. Use null for unavailable or future artifacts and"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "## Required Output"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "bf39173ac6fa402897da15df2a474cc4e8c4a0d6718dbfa1fe997f5a745a32ee",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "- Provide optional TaskContract.v1 and TaskPlan.v1 sidecars and a manual dependency-map projection only when machine interchange is useful."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8a85940f2e9c602de4fffcf333528865c0c51040ef97d28d566268a0fb2d81da",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "- Use an empty design list for no supplied design and an empty allowed-write list for no writes. Do not manufacture completed tasks or implementation evidence."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5b824904802b4820cf313725e80228a4f0740ce84dd6ee9e6a2a6462dbe65b77",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "Load only the needed resource route from `resources/resource-map.json`: run"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1c0f01ccc7f336d06c8f8a282ca85253e34741cbc7f1998f56eca985ed83ecd6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "This capability owns planning artifacts only. Do not implement product code,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5404eb1fe13358883485019143a76a64c3b2ea7cf86d8e61916836c55bea5d65",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "unauthorized access is denied if that is required by the source. Keep export code,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "34545ca9adfe1bcae29974977743c21d199b512fbbb87d8b331696b4391ca396",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "completed evidence remains applicable, and which dependent checks must reopen."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3454f6519a4ba533249a7cca64c2016a899e2fd879bac7e450548dda527c1500",
      "source": "ssot/engos-design-plan-implementation.md",
      "text": "workflow; no multi-task plan or JSON is required. \u201cPlan this migration for Batman\u201d"
    },
    {
