      "text": "\"description\": \"Optional projection of the authoritative plan and existing tracker. No automatic approval, property-level unique task IDs, dependency/cycle validation, completed-ID membership, coverage, source truth, authority or execution checks. Null hashes identify unavailable byte binding; do not invent digests.\","
